// The `to_string` slot of a `dyn Display` value's method table for a type
// with no `impl Display` of its own: a number, a `bool`, a `char`, a
// `String` (design.md § `dyn Trait`, B-2026-10-29-31).
//
// The MIR pipeline appends this file to the program, and the builder names
// the function. The legacy backends do not read it.

fn dyn_display_to_string[T: Display](x: T) -> String {
    x.to_string()
}
